    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Happytoutous is listed as a dog sitting service in Grasse, in the Alpes-Maritimes. No page of its own for this service, no website and no profile on the sitting platforms consulted could be read on 13/11/2026, so the exact services (sitting at home, boarding at the sitter's place, walks) are not detailed here.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>To get a sense of prices in Grasse, the Animaute platform states, on its page for the town, that sitting with a pet sitter there generally costs between 10 € and 24 € per day, i.e. between 70 € and 154 € per week. The platform listed 21 pet sitters in Grasse. These amounts are platform averages and are not Happytoutous's price list.</p>
      <p>Before leaving your dog, ask in writing about the services offered, the price, the number of dogs looked after at the same time and, for sitting at home or at the sitter's place, an introductory meeting with your dog. For a professional sitting activity, you can also ask for the knowledge certificate (ACACED); it could not be verified for this listing.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: take the time for a first meeting on site with your dog before any stay of several days, and get the price and dates confirmed in writing.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Grasse is the reference point of this listing; the town's Animaute page lists pet sitters in flats as well as houses, which makes it possible to compare several nearby sitting options.</p>
